{"id":"710894633","kind":"article","title":"电子游戏允许即时的探索","author":"Issa Rice","original_authors":["Issa Rice"],"original_source_urls":["https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Video_games_allow_immediate_exploration"],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"Issawiki & Learning","date":"2024-07-25","updated":"2026-10-27","votes":11,"comment_count":0,"minutes":1,"chars":289,"keywords":["电子游戏","数学学习","工作记忆","探索式学习"],"summary":"这则短译文指出，电子游戏的视觉对象通常与游戏状态直接对应，玩家可以即时操作和探索；数学问题则需先在工作记忆中构建问题情境，因此探索方式不同。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/710894633","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":3,"title":"参见"},{"id":"sec-2","level":3,"title":"链接到本文"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"4h9Qq4U6\">在电子游戏中，游戏对象与屏幕上呈现的视觉元素通常是一一对应的。这种设计使得玩家可以直接、直观地探索游戏世界，同时也为游戏编程提供了便利。</p><p data-pid=\"EEZegaeT\">相比之下，探索数学问题则有着本质的不同，因为<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Tinkering_in_math_requires_loading_the_situation_into_working_memory\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">数学探索需要将问题加载到工作记忆</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>。</p><h3 id=\"sec-1\">参见</h3><ul><li data-pid=\"kIDstuwR\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Braid_for_math\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">面向数学的 Braid</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup></li></ul><h3 id=\"sec-2\">链接到本文</h3><ul><li data-pid=\"2k7c8JTo\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Video_games_comparison_to_math\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">比较电子游戏与数学</a> ‎ (<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/index.php?title=Special:WhatLinksHere&amp;target=Video+games+comparison+to+math\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">← links</a>)<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"8XeF_8Ft\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Tinkering_in_math_requires_loading_the_situation_into_working_memory\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">数学探索需要将问题加载到工作记忆</a> ‎ (<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/index.php?title=Special:WhatLinksHere&amp;target=Tinkering+in+math+requires+loading+the+situation+into+working+memory\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">← links</a>)</li></ul><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"Qz7OYscf\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>感谢主要译者 claude-3.5-sonnet、校对 Jarrett Ye<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Video_games_allow_immediate_exploration\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Video games allow immediate exploration</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 数学探索需要将问题情境加载到工作记忆 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"713659217\" href=\"#/post/713659217\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 面向数学的《时空幻境》 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"715765481\" href=\"#/post/715765481\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"707701579","title":"在解释学中你并不需要践行自己提倡的原则","author":"Issa Rice","votes":19,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · Issawiki & Learning"},{"id":"713659217","title":"数学探索需要将问题情境加载到工作记忆","author":"Issa Rice","votes":20,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · Issawiki & Learning"},{"id":"716414197","title":"对比数学与电子游戏","author":"Issa Rice","votes":16,"minutes":1,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"715765481","title":"面向数学的《时空幻境》","author":"Issa Rice","votes":16,"minutes":1,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"1944442771533432041","title":"纠错练习","author":"Vipul","votes":8,"minutes":3,"reason":"跨学派视角 · Vipul"}],"rec_answers":[]}